<mxCell id="box20" value="&lt;b&gt;Stricter option: network isolated cluster&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbound type none (or block, preview) and bootstrap artifact source Cache:&lt;br&gt;AKS pulls its own images and binaries from a private ACR cache, so creating, scaling and upgrading the cluster needs no egress.&lt;br&gt;Add egress back only for what your workloads actually call." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D4A72C;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=center;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="515" width="940" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
